<title>SWITZERLAND: Alusuisse to focus on six sectors.</title>
<headline>Alusuisse to focus on six sectors.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alusuisse Lonza Group said it plans to focus its activities in six sectors and divest some businesses accounting for some 800 million Swiss francs in sales.</p>
</text>
